{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1211081-craft-specializations","id":1211081,"title":"Craft Specializations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-24T11:41:18-07:00","id":1211081,"title":"Craft Specializations","content":"All the books say you need a specialization. Mage says you need to buy Crafts for each specialization. But Changeling and Werewolf (haven't bothered with Vampire because I'm sure it will only further confuse the issue) say that a specialization is need but you don't need to buy Crafts multiple times to have multiple crafting skills like Mage says you do.<br /> <br /> Which is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23984-thkaal","name":"Thkaal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T11:50:51-07:00","id":1211086,"title":"","content":"Whichever game you're using. The games don't have unified rules even on small stuff like this despite being so close to being the same.<br /> <br /> My personal preference is the Well-Skilled Craftsman rules from M20 or the alternate Ability Specialty rules from Dark Ages: Revised to resolve this: Don't buy multiple Crafts, buy multiple Specialties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby